{"id":3006,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>&nbsp; 为庆祝2026年“三八”国际劳动妇女节，关爱女教职工身心健康，丰富精神文化生活，信息与通信工程学院工会于3月9日，举办穿衣色系搭配女性沙龙活动。</p><p>&nbsp; 活动现场温馨雅致，学院工会为每位到场女教师献上鲜花，致以节日美好祝福。本次沙龙特邀艺术之美创始人丁燕老师主讲，围绕“如何定制专属于你的‘LOGO色’”，系统讲解色彩美学、穿衣搭配技巧，并为老师们开展一对一色彩测试。</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;老师们积极参与互动交流、现场测评，在专业指导下明晰个人肤色与色彩适配度，学习科学穿搭、打造专属形象。大家在轻松愉悦的氛围中收获美学知识，提升审美与形象管理能力，充分展现了学院女教职工自信优雅、热爱生活的精神风貌。</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;此次活动以美育赋能生活，既传递了工会的暖心关怀，也为大家搭建了交流互动的平台，进一步增强了团队凝聚力与归属感。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=2nmGdZLNLaMzCPL-mQVozvZnmMRU4UW8ol74nN78ozQ2M870gihFp2hmCIa0nkyPLSyPn1yZozNZUzf7MmVkM4VRoR7aMRrVLRG4nmNDnmVFMllZMl-DL8VFLzNPolUJqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47DM4vbgtA8pUHcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=16779&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/D111F8998A0D61B71C81045E003F96F1/5E85B63A/1919D\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=2nmGdZLNLaMzCPL-mQVozvZnmMRU4UW8ol74nN78ozQ2M870gihFp2hmCIa0nkyPLSyPn1yZozNZUzf7MmVkM4VRoR7aMRrVLRG4nmNDnmVFMllZMl-DL8VFLzNPolUJqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47DM4vbgtA8pUHcc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=16779&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=2M4ld4M7Usnm-PU-zlaoR7iM4T7MRCW4M4WRLNlsU8LaolC0gihFp2hmCIa0nSyPUYyaLSyDUmf2ozQ7nmQkLNnVUmNbMzMRo7CYnm7anRfFMmviMzG8UmAFU462nSb/v2veo4Oe_dAb6dAjCYhXptQ0g47aLmL0LzCsM4NJqdHnx&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=16779&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/E1C016B0F96DF6B2DEB9953C8F2F10D0/675504B8/C7FE\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=2M4ld4M7Usnm-PU-zlaoR7iM4T7MRCW4M4WRLNlsU8LaolC0gihFp2hmCIa0nSyPUYyaLSyDUmf2ozQ7nmQkLNnVUmNbMzMRo7CYnm7anRfFMmviMzG8UmAFU462nSb/v2veo4Oe_dAb6dAjCYhXptQ0g47aLmL0LzCsM4NJqdHnx&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=16779&e=.jpg\"></p><p><br><br></p><p><br></p></div></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://5y.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=2nmGdZLNLaMzCPL-mQVozvZnmMRU4UW8ol74nN78ozQ2M870gihFp2hmCIa0nkyPLSyPn1yZozNZUzf7MmVkM4VRoR7aMRrVLRG4nmNDnmVFMllZMl-D